{
  "description": "Five day notification for tree works: Removal of sections of three roots adjacent to the front boundary of 127 Camberwell Road works in relation to full planning permission and associated Listed Building Consent 26/AP/0741 and to abate a nuisance (trip hazard).  The measurements of the roots are as follows: \rRemove section of Root A : Diameter 25mm, length 15cm. \rRemove section of Root B : Diameter 38mm, length 25cm. \rRemove section of Root C : Diameter 60mm, length 28cm. \rAll end cuts would be undertaken with a sharp, curved pruning saw, and then immediately back-filled with loose topsoil and compacted to 95%.\r",
